------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 Catapult
Text=This DaVinci invention looks to be a unique prototype of a new siege catapult. The invention is not complete and does not look functional.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 Sweeper
Text=This device appears to be a fearsome war machine, with sharp rotating blades for use against ground troops. It appears incomplete and does not look functional.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 Siege Tank
Text=Heavy wheels and covered turrets hint at this hulking vehicle's purpose. Once completed, this siege vehicle looks like it could cause tremendous damage to its targets.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Fixt Tank Gear Carried
Reply Text=(look at where the ring would go)
Go to node ID=3 Fixt the empty shaft
