Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 Fixt the ring goes in
Text=<The ring drops over the shaft, and you lean on it until it seats with a sound like a key turning in a lock the size of a door. The turret swings a hand's breadth and stops, because nothing inside it is alive yet. Forty-one teeth, true to a thousandth, and the quiet of a machine that is only waiting now.>
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=(step back from it)
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 Fixt the empty shaft
Text=<The turret ring sits on a bare shaft at the back of the hull, keyed, oiled and empty. Somebody has wiped it down recently, which is either hope or habit. The rotary gear in your pack is cut for exactly this, and nothing else in the room is.>
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Fixt Tank Gear Carried
Reply Text=(fit the rotary gear into the turret ring)
Go to node ID=2 Fixt the ring goes in
